From 48916b05e9f77962e131eb8d198cf000123eba7f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gamblingaddict <112048350+gamblingaddict@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 08:44:52 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add colour converter in GLConsumer

This fixes hardware video decoding on apps that use a TextureView
for video playback.
Mostly based on this patch, and revised by Claude and ChatGPT.
https://github.com/noobas1937/android_frameworks_native/blob/master/0001-frameworks_native-add-mtk-stuffs.patch

Change-Id: I2317100d66c8be4a242767bed45bb526825a95c7
---
